Russh compatibility maintenance

Based on Russh 0.62.4 at 0089c89c94753bebbec12b956c07a1cd38740379:
https://github.com/Eugeny/russh

Sailry contributors update the exact RSA and PKCS#1 release candidates to
0.10.0-rc.19 and 0.8.0-rc.5, and use the renamed borrowed RsaPrivateKeyRef
type. This preserves RSA SSH support alongside GPUI Kit 0.8.1 standard
modules. No other production source changes are applied.

